; FBX 7.5.0 project file
; A triangle skinned to bones A (root) and C (child of A). C was bound with no rotation but
; saved rotated 30 degrees about Z. Clip "Pose" keys only A, holding it constant at its bind
; position, so that track is redundant and dropped. The clip must still play: C holds its
; saved rotation while it does.

